  "raw_comment": "1. I notice that the states in the middle of the country experience the most severe droughts. I also noticed that a lot of the country is experiencing severe droughts, even in areas near water sources, and mountain ranges.\n\n2. I wonder why many of the hot and dry states aren't experiencing droughts like the middle of the country? I also wonder how global warming and climate change is affecting these droughts. \n\n3. This impacts my coummunity as I live in Mass, and my state experienced moderate and severe droughts, and I did not even realize. I also used to live in California where I experienced a lot of droughts.\n\n4. The United States or the Sahara Desert: How Have Droughts effected the country?",
